[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642854064","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102513#issuecomment-2642854064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102513","id":2642854064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dhsCw","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T13:03:12Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T13:03:12Z","body":"> One potential problem with large project is that the scanning could take a while and the user has no feedback.\r\n\r\nFor what it's worth, when testing this PR on a real-world project with thousands of resource files, I'm not seeing any noticeable regression in pure wall time when deleting `uid_cache.bin` and measuring from editor start to when all the various scan dialogs and progress bars are gone.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642854064/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643030865","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102513#issuecomment-2643030865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102513","id":2643030865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6diXNR","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T14:03:35Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T14:03:35Z","body":"I did some tests this morning, and below are the added loading times for the editor when the UID cache is missing, and a UID is required before the first scan (e.g., `run/main_scene` project settings):  \r\n\r\n- **3000 files** (without `.import` and `.uid`): **1.5 sec**  \r\n- **60000 files** (without `.import` and `.uid`): **48 sec**  \r\n\r\nOne way to improve this could be to avoid scanning the entire project when looking up a single UID and instead stop as soon as it is found. However, the challenge and potential drawback of this approach is that if multiple UIDs are needed, multiple rescans may be required.\r\n\r\nThat's why I suggest scanning everything. Technically, this \"scan for UIDs\" should not happen often, except in CI/CD environments where the UID cache will always be missing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643030865/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643156754","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102513#issuecomment-2643156754","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102513","id":2643156754,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6di18S","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T14:51:20Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T14:51:20Z","body":"> * **3000 files** (without `.import` and `.uid`): **1.5 sec**\r\n> * **60000 files** (without `.import` and `.uid`): **48 sec**\r\n\r\nRight, yeah, the \"real-world project\" in question was definitely closer to 3k than 60k. A second here or there wasn't really what I was looking out for. :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643156754/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643467884","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102513#issuecomment-2643467884","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102513","id":2643467884,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dkB5s","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T16:52:40Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T16:52:40Z","body":"Fixes the issues.\r\n\r\nTested with my big project and the scan was not noticeable. I tested by deleting `uid_cache.bin` and `filesystem_cache10` and I assume the project is supposed to hang on splash screen.\r\n\r\nHowever there is one error remaining - if your splash screen path is stored as UID, you will still get an error about unrecognized UID.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643467884/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643574523","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102513#issuecomment-2643574523","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102513","id":2643574523,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dkb77","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T17:37:50Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T17:37:50Z","body":"Thanks for the review and testing.\r\n\r\nFixing the boot splash screen will be a bit trickier. The problem is that the logo is loaded before the resources format importers are loaded. If I move `ResourceUID::scan_for_uid_on_startup = EditorFileSystem::scan_for_uid;` just before `setup_boot_logo`, the `ResourceFormatImporter::get_singleton()->get_recognized_extensions` returns no extensions. That causes to not be able to get the UID for extensions like `.tscn`.\r\n\r\nSince the issue is not supposed to happen that often, I did a little check before calling`ResourceUID::ensure_path` on the boot logo path to prevent printing errors.\r\n\r\nThe alternative could be to display the boot logo later in the start sequence or put the loading of the `ResourceFormatImporter` sooner, but I fear that could lead to serious side effects and this close to a release candidate, I think it's a bad idea for this small issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643574523/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643587136","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102513#issuecomment-2643587136","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102513","id":2643587136,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dkfBA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T17:43:10Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T17:43:10Z","body":"Yeah, removing errors is enough.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643587136/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643735449","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102513#issuecomment-2643735449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102513","id":2643735449,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dlDOZ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T18:55:26Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T18:56:05Z","body":"> I did a little check before callingResourceUID::ensure_path on the boot logo path to prevent printing errors.\r\n\r\nDid you test whether it fixes the errors? 🙃\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af71f82b-a051-48b7-be74-47b0d20e8458)\r\nIf the UID is not available, it should make the path empty to fallback to default splash screen.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2